6.153.m:
Truly, truly, it was obtained through the power of the sacred ford, O fair-faced one!
Knowing this, O goddess of gods, one should perform bathing right there;
beholding Maheśa destroys all sins.

6.174.m:
Prahlāda said:
"O Lord, by your favor I have heard the unsurpassed vow;
I wish to hear the fruit of this vow, which is the cause of my devotion to you."
